  WrittenDialogue: "I’m not even close to getting out but it feels like I’ve been here for so long.\nI’ve become institutionalized. Violent.\nNot sure what the system has in store, or if I’ll be the next one to die in my block.\nWhen push comes to shove I show no love.\nJust 19 more years..."
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
